I currently have a character who read a scroll of punishment on level 3
or so and hasn't been able to get rid of the ball ever since.  However,
I found that the heavy iron ball is just about the best weapon you can
get (assuming you have strength enough to carry it).  Now I really don't
want to get rid of the ball until I get my hands on Stormbringer or Mjollnir.
The ball plus a red dragon for a pet is all one needs to survive.  My
dragon wiped out a whole barracks full of soldiers while I just putzed
around nearby.  Also the first thing the dragon does when we go into
a shop is kill the shopkeeper.  This way I get all the stuff I want and
no bad luck for killing a peaceful human.  Pretty nifty, huh?



